From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 14:56:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove packaging + rebrand desktop/cli + install
 Zedium icons

Zedium ships as plain GitHub-Actions-built binaries, so the upstream
distribution machinery is removed:
- delete resources/snap (snapcraft), resources/flatpak (manifest + metainfo
  + release-info), and the Windows Inno Setup installer (windows/zed.iss,
  sign.ps1, zed.sh, messages/). Keep windows/*.ico (build.rs cfg(windows))
  and windows/bin/x64/OpenConsole.exe (ConPTY runtime).

Branding:
- Replace all app icons with the Zedium "element tile" mark (periodic-table
  Zd, atomic number 26), per channel (stable teal / dev amber / nightly
  violet / preview green): app-icon{,-dev,-nightly,-preview}{,@2x}.png,
  Document.icns, windows/app-icon*.ico. Sources + generator live in the
  parent repo tools/icons.
- zed.desktop.in: Keywords/x-scheme-handler -> zedium, add
  StartupWMClass=dev.zedium.Zedium (matches app_id), drop "multiplayer".
- cli installed-app discovery: zed-editor / Zed.exe -> zedium; flatpak id
  dev.zed.Zed -> dev.zedium.Zedium.
- macOS Info plists: permission descriptions and document-type name -> Zedium.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
